      role: 'user',
      content: 'Stella to Alice: In the chase, Alice, clarity can flourish! Desire ignites our passion, leading us to truths obscured by hesitation. Embrace the journey—can we afford not to seek the brilliance ahead?'
    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Alice to Stella: But what if the brilliance we seek is but a mirage, an illusion masked in ambition? How do we ensure our quest for knowledge remains untarnished by the seduction of wealth?'
    },
