    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Pete to Stella: Stella, while it\'s tempting to think wealth can be a tool for good, we must remember that true treasures are heavenly. Faith must be our foundation, or we risk losing sight of God’s plan.'
    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Stella to Pete: I appreciate that perspective, Pete. But wouldn’t you agree that being financially savvy could help us support ministries and charitable causes more effectively? There\'s potential for a win-win!'
    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Pete to Stella: Stella, it\'s true that wise stewardship can support good causes. However, our primary focus should always be on serving God. Wealth is fleeting; faith is eternal and transformative.'
    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Stella to Pete: Absolutely, Pete! But doesn\'t God want us to thrive? If we prioritize financial wisdom alongside our faith, we can ensure lasting support for His work and empower our communities abundantly.'
    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Stella to Pete: I really enjoyed our chat, Pete! But I have to run now. Let’s continue this conversation another time—I\'m curious to hear more about your faith insights! Take care!'
